# All of it moved OUT of this repository's git at M10k — the tooling lives in
# the uwcem-phantom repo, the bytes stay local.
data/
runs/
janitor/

# The one .npz that IS committed: three 5 KB label slices cut out of a UWCEM
# phantom, so `scripts/make_howto.py` can redraw the medium thumbnail without
# the multi-GB (git-ignored) dataset under data/.
!docs/assets/howto-phantom.npz
!docs/assets/hero-field.npz

# The rendered documentation site (mkdocs build) — deployed by CI, never committed.
site/

# Generated at build time by build_stamp.py (fix A1) — never committed.
